{"duration_api_ms":192347,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f8562840-31dd-49bf-8b9b-57cf17afe1a2","total_cost_usd":0.2415,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15804,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":17828,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":12834},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15804,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":17828,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15804,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15804},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":17828,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15804,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2415,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":12834,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is one line of designs at D~3.384, B=1.2, cone=70, spread over gamma from -1.5 to -3.567. Flux runs 227k to 275k W/m2 and bondline T runs 418 to 391 K. The front is pinned at three limits: D by heatshield mass fraction (margin ~0 at D=3.385), gamma by max_g (margin 0.0005 at -3.567), and B and cone by the surrogate hull and the variable bound. Eight of the ten geometry failures came from trying B>1.2, so B=1.2 is the practical ceiling. Hypervolume gains have shrunk to about 0.0003 per round, so the front is near saturation. The fixed 2.5e6 flux reference means a real hypervolume gain would need lower T at similar flux, and I found no lever for that in the data.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-78a9a956afab (gamma -3.567) has max_g margin 0.0005 and mass margin 0.00014. C-733cdcb996ae (D=3.385) has mass margin 0.00014 against 0.00074 at D=3.384, so the D cap is about 3.3852.\",\"C-1618bda1fac0 (D=3.2, gamma -3.7, g=12.139) and C-94a9f7a46f9b (D=3.2, gamma -3.8, g=12.309) sit about 0.07 below the D=3.384 g-vs-gamma line. So g falls only ~0.4 per metre of D, which lets gamma steepen by only ~0.24 deg per metre. Meanwhile flux and T rise strongly as D falls (C-94a9f7a46f9b: 304k W/m2 and 392.2 K, worse than the corner), so shrinking D does not pay.\",\"Along the D=3.384 line, T falls about 10-13 K/deg of steepening and flux rises about 24k W/m2/deg (e.g. C-6a031c8b7ef2 to C-78a9a956afab). Both are nearly linear, so interpolated gamma values are predictable.\",\"C-0202524b57fd, C-1d24bfa5f84e, C-5b57439845df, C-4b1b4e110042, C-68332aab55f2, C-3d41ce848a30 and C-05beb8f06d5f all failed the cd_fore convex-hull check. That confirms B>1.2 is unreachable; the sixth failure, C-3cd51d4bc9fc, is a cone-angle geometry failure. So I keep B<=1.2 and cone=70.\",\"Off-corner designs such as C-f84c59a3cc23, C-b545729400dd and C-4cf8bee56534 are infeasible on max_g or mass fraction, so they give no route to a lower T.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Peak g depends almost entirely on gamma, with a weak D dependence, which caps gamma near -3.57. Flux and T fall as D, B and cone rise, because ballistic coefficient drops and nose radius grows. That pushes D, B and cone to their caps (mass fraction, hull, bound). This is my physical reading of the data, partly informed by the general Rn^-0.5 stagnation-heating scaling from prior knowledge. Little hypervolume is left, so I spend most of the slots on gamma values not yet evaluated, including gaps in the front where flux steps by 3-5k. I also push gamma and D to the g and mass limits, and add two low-cost probes: one near the mass cap and one on the D-g tradeoff.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The main risk is duplicates of the 19 front points I cannot see; I used non-round gamma values to reduce that. Interpolated T and flux should be good to about 0.1 K and 0.3k W/m2. The limit-pushing points (gamma near -3.57, D near 3.3852) may cross g or mass-fraction margins of ~1e-4. The B=1.19 and D=3.3 probes rely on extrapolating the mass-fraction and g dependence on D and B from only a few points.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-78a9a956afab\",\"rationale\":\"Push gamma to the g cap. g is about 11.998 at -3.5695, so the margin stays slightly positive.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5695},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274550,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the exact g limit at the corner; this is the lowest-T end of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-78a9a956afab\",\"rationale\":\"D slightly above 3.385 with gamma just short of the g limit, testing how far the mass cap can be pushed.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3851,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5683},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274520,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.11,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the linear mass-margin extrapolation (zero near D=3.3852) at the corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-78a9a956afab\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 sits at the extrapolated mass cap; gamma stays at a safe g margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5661},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274490,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.13,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Finds the exact D cap; it may fail the mass fraction by a hair.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-385f3798bd45\",\"rationale\":\"Fills a gap on the front between gamma -3.48 and -3.55.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5237},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273570,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.56,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds coverage of the trade-off curve near the end where T is lowest.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a201e4576c17\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between -3.4 and -3.45 to fill a front gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4213},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271130,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.57,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-013d6de46fd0\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between -3.2 and -3.3 to fill a flux gap of about 2.4k.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2513},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":267030,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.31,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-733cdcb996ae\",\"rationale\":\"Probe B sensitivity just below the hull edge. The mass margin should rise slightly with D=3.38, and flux and T should rise slightly from the lower B.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.19,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Measures the B gradient and mass-margin dependence near the corner. Expect it to be dominated, but it informs later rounds.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4da368065e68\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -3.0 and -3.2, where the flux gap is about 4.8k.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.1037},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":263470,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.89,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the largest gap in the mid-front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-733cdcb996ae\",\"rationale\":\"Test the D-g tradeoff: D=3.3 should lower g by ~0.035, but flux and T rise by about 11k W/m2 and 1.5 K. I expect it to be dominated.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":285800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks whether a smaller D can buy enough gamma to offset its T penalty. If not, it closes that direction.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-9f046db94e96\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.9 and -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.9513},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":259820,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.59,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2ae6f3629903\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.8 and -2.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.8487},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":257360,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.77,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4dc37a3f4f3a\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.7 and -2.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.7488},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":254980,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.96,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-33e6eb4c0f08\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.6 and -2.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.6488},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":252610,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-5781505ca825\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.4 and -2.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4513},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":247970,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d6570e7303ea\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.2 and -2.4, a 4.6k flux gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.3013},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":244500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.73,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a mid-front gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-84073f408d06\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.05 and -2.2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.1013},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":239950,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":408.53,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-8bc2f6a84889\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -1.75 and -1.9, a 3.2k flux gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.8513},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":234480,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.26,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a front gap at the shallow end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ee762cc58d0f\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -1.75 and -1.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.8013},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":233420,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.03,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-1120f80f8763\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -1.65 and -1.75.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7013},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":231310,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.63,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-92f6aed905e3\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -1.5 and -1.55 at the flux-minimum end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5237},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227780,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.51,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves coverage at the low-flux extreme.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":150876,"type":"result","duration_ms":192385,"uuid":"ac2586b6-2d3f-48dd-b5bc-327c91d90a39","ttft_stream_ms":1556,"time_to_request_ms":38,"first_content_frame_ms":1556,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
